WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.020
Ask Christians what happens after death,
and you'll hear more than one answer.

2
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.910
Some speak of heaven and
hell: being with God for ever,

3
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.410
or cut off from God for ever.

4
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:16.110
Some take Jesus' warnings literally;
others read them as pictures.

5
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.250
And some hope that, in the
end, all people will be saved.

6
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.450
So what do Christians
believe happens after we die,

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.830
and why don't they all agree?

8
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.860
In this mission, you'll
read what Jesus told Martha,

9
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.620
whose brother had died.

10
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:36.730
Then you'll weigh up a hard question:
would a loving God send anyone to hell?

11
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.860
Your mission: find out what Christians
believe happens after death,

12
00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.450
and why they disagree.
